  "createdAt": "2026-10-12T12:14:10.122551Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-12T12:29:47.120053Z",
  "totalBlocks": 24,
  "translatedBlocks": 24,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8057b6f40d8c4845",
      "translationZh": "我经常看到有人推荐说，ik_llama.cpp（ikawrakow 的分支）在 CPU/GPU 混合卸载和 MoE 性能方面是无可争议的王者。然而，每次我将它与 ggml-org 主线版本进行基准测试对比时，主线版本总是以很大的优势胜出。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a14d77bae416a85e",
      "translationZh": "是我漏用了某些特定的参数，还是 ik_llama 根本就不是为多 GPU 层拆分设计的？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b943cf16d1d72fac",
      "translationZh": "我的机器配置与硬件限制：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "546d1558e617f616",
      "translationZh": "主机 CPU：Intel Core i9-10920X（12 个物理核心，已启用 AVX-512 和 VNNI）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ac27b899698f301a",
      "translationZh": "GPU：4 块 GPU 的非对称配置：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "06efc45e42d32830",
      "translationZh": "GPU 0、1、3：NVIDIA P102-100（10GB，Pascal 架构，存在 PCIe 1.0 总线瓶颈）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7547a9c9cd1a8a75",
      "translationZh": "GPU 2：RTX 3060 12GB（Ampere 架构，通过 -mg 2 充当主节点）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d2dd5de734fd1a7b",
      "translationZh": "已知的硬件规律 / 变通方案：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2f57d3b6709e1484",
      "translationZh": "我在 4 张显卡上使用层拆分（-sm layer），并采用非对称张量拆分（-ts）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a9a6fe2a7b815a42",
      "translationZh": "Pascals 的显存占用必须严格低于 9.7 GB；超过这一限制就会触发 PCIe 微分页，导致速度骤降。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a57820ca68e6b641",
      "translationZh": "我在主线版本上使用 --poll 100，防止 AVX-512 CPU 线程在 GPU 层之间交接时进入低功耗睡眠状态。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "543f24d4b06e8b60",
      "translationZh": "模型：Qwen 3.8 Flash-Next 177B Uncensored（IQ3_XXS，约 89 GB），带有多模态视觉功能（mmproj）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f9dd53e2a405c5d8",
      "translationZh": "卸载：将 35 层卸载到 4 块 GPU 上（-ngl 35），剩余 13 层在 AVX-512 CPU 上计算。上下文长度为 32k。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f79bad48700b29bf",
      "translationZh": "正面对比基准测试：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "013013bf4213eade",
      "translationZh": "主线版本（ggml-org/llama.cpp）：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "86d108140d622496",
      "translationZh": "提示词评估：19.70 tokens/sec",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5585851f682d04cd",
      "translationZh": "Token 生成：10.86 tokens/sec",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7da32282a7ad3b0c",
      "translationZh": "CUDA 图：在各个 GPU 上复用了 2,490 个 CUDA 图。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cf1aaa93ebee41c0",
      "translationZh": "提示词评估：5.48 tokens/sec（下降 72%）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "447a08cca4a7ed33",
      "translationZh": "Token 生成：8.43 tokens/sec（下降 22%）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7782bd9b37caf0e7",
      "translationZh": "观察结果：启用了 0 个 CUDA 图。它在生成过程中花时间保存上下文检查点（停顿 100ms+），且不支持 --poll。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "198d035a9cb76fde",
      "translationZh": "ik_llama.cpp 的速度优势是否仅适用于纯 CPU 推理或单 GPU 系统？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3847308802c6e9d4",
      "translationZh": "当通过 PCIe 协调异构 GPU 之间的流水线式层拆分时，它的自定义 CPU 线程池是否就不行了，而主线版本的 CUDA 图缓存则发挥了作用？很想听听运行混合多 GPU 配置的用户的经验。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "daacd4f9010220d6",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/vulcan4d 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
  "wordWise": [
    {
      "term": "hybrid CPU/GPU offloading",
      "briefZh": "混合卸载",
      "explanationZh": "将模型计算分配到 CPU 和 GPU 上执行，以利用两者的计算与内存资源。"
    },
    {
      "term": "MoE",
      "briefZh": "混合专家",
      "explanationZh": "一种包含多个专家模块的模型架构，通常为每个输入选择部分专家参与计算。"
    },
    {
      "term": "mainline",
      "briefZh": "主线版本",
      "explanationZh": "项目主要开发分支的版本，与派生分支或修改版本相对。"
    },
    {
      "term": "multi-GPU layer splitting",
      "briefZh": "多卡层拆分",
      "explanationZh": "将模型的不同层分配到多个 GPU 上执行。"
    },
    {
      "term": "physical cores",
